## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates practical KCA design for mobile fintech SDKs, including attestation, per-user scopes, streaming policies, and offline revocation.

## Key Concepts
- Device attestation, SPIFFE IDs, TLS certificates, TTLs, streaming policy updates
- Per-user policy binding, regional bootstrap, auditing and revocation in offline scenarios
- Mobile PKI considerations and crypto agility

## Code Example
